# Build output published into the project tree, the species codegen's private build, and above all
# the RUN STORE. `COPY . .` copies the build context into the image, and a single stored run is tens
# of gigabytes of exported frames - publish_and_run.sh now puts the store at the repo root, so
# without this a `docker build` would try to ship the entire simulation archive into the image.
AgroServer/publish/
SchemeGenerator/artifacts/
ThreeFrontend/build
